             "color": "#1E3A43"
            }
           },
           "html": "<p><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Gort na Coiribe is a development of apartments and townhouses situated in a prime location in the center of Galway and just a short distance from the popular Eyre Square.  Accommodations range from two-six bedroom apartments consisting of both single and twin rooms.  The housing is situated in a beautiful residential setting that is safe and comfortable.  Most apartments are used as student housing for the National University in Galway during the school year.  </span></p>"
